      <title>Why Everyone Wants to Meet With Kim Jong Un</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-10-20/why-everyone-wants-to-meet-with-kim-jong-un</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">0e83f0fcbcf08a30cac0510e</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:00:08 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Kim Jong Un might be the world’s most in-demand leader. US President Donald Trump wants to meet him during a visit to Asia next month. So, too, does South Korean President Lee Jae Myung and Japan’s Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi. He stood shoulder-to-shoulder with Xi Jinping and Vladimir Putin at a giant military parade in Beijing last year, and has an outstanding invitation to visit Russia.</description>
